# Mazemind Tome's state trigger ("When there are four or more page counters on this artifact, exile it. If you do, you
# gain 4 life") "doesn't trigger again until the ability has resolved, has been countered, or has otherwise left the
# stack" (CR 603.8) - the ability that triggered, not a copy of it: a copy was never triggered (CR 707.10). Bot1 puts
# the fourth page counter on turn 7; Bot2 copies the trigger with Return the Favor and then counters the original under
# the copy with Ertai Resurrected (Bot1, its controller, draws). With only the copy left on the stack the Tome, still
# with four counters, triggers again at once, above the copy: that trigger exiles the Tome and Bot1 gains 4 life, and
# Bot2's copy then finds no Tome to exile - Bot2 gains nothing.

